If you are using his services voluntarily it is. This isn't like
income taxes. Besides, you work for NASA, and presumably work to help
the government demonstrate that it can do a good job of launching
space probes. I suspect that the damage you cause there is far greater
than any damage that the few dollars a year you might do by giving
them money in postage could do.

